</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Bohannon Energy</h1>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
                    <li><a href="services.html" class="active">Services</a></li>
                    <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>BER Assessment Services</h2>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="service-item">
                <h3>Domestic BER Assessments</h3>
                <p>I provide official BER (Building Energy Rating) assessments for houses and apartments, as required by Irish law for all property sales and rentals, and for most SEAI home energy grant applications.</p>
                <p>The assessment includes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>On-site survey of the dwelling (approximately 1-2 hours depending on size)</li>
                    <li>Measurement of dimensions, insulation levels, window types, heating systems, ventilation, and renewable energy technologies</li>
                    <li>Calculation of energy performance using approved software (DEAP - Dwelling Energy Assessment Procedure)</li>
                    <li>Generation of the BER certificate and advisory report</li>
                    <li>Registration of the BER with the national BER register</li>
                </ul>
                <p>The BER certificate rates the energy performance of your dwelling on a scale from A (most efficient) to G (least efficient) and includes:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Primary energy consumption per square meter per year (kWh/m²/yr)</li>
                    <li>Carbon dioxide emissions (kg CO₂/m²/yr)</li>
                    <li>Advisory report with cost-effective recommendations for improving energy performance</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="contact.html" class="btn">Schedule Assessment</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="service-item">
                <h3>SEAI Grant Application Support</h3>
                <p>Many SEAI home energy grants (such as the Home Energy Upgrade grants) require a BER assessment as part of the application process. I can provide the necessary BER assessment to support your grant application.</p>
                <p>Note: While I provide the BER assessment, grant applications are submitted by you or your chosen contractor. The BER is a prerequisite for many grant schemes.</p>
                <a href="contact.html" class="btn">Learn More</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Need a BER Assessment?</h2>
            <p>Whether you're selling, renting, or applying for an SEAI grant, I provide fast, accurate, and compliant BER assessments for domestic dwellings.</p>
            <a href="contact.html" class="btn">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
